---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Wes Cramblitt — Product-Led Scientific Software Engineering
description: "Building an ecosystem of modular, high-performance scientific software — put to work through product-led consulting: licensed, customized, or built on for engineering and research teams."
extraScripts:
  - https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js
  - https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/ScrambleTextPlugin.min.js
  - /scripts/media-tiles.js
---
<div class="hero hero--gradient">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1 data-scramble>Wes Cramblitt</h1>
    <p class="lede">Building an ecosystem of modular, high-performance scientific software — and putting it to work through product-led consulting: licensed, customized, or built on for engineering and research teams.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="button button--blue-light" href="#products">Explore the products</a>
      <a class="button button--green" href="/engineering/">Start an Engagement</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="products" class="wrap section-block">
  <div class="section-top">
    <h2>Extropian Ecosystem</h2>
    <p class="normal">A modular scientific software ecosystem of specialized components that combine into complete engineering systems. Interactive demonstrations are on the way.</p>
    
  </div>
  {%- from "partials/product-browser.njk" import productBrowser %}
  {{ productBrowser(collections.productsByOrder, 'pb-home', true) }}
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="button button--ghost" href="/products/">View all products →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="offer" class="wrap section-block">
  <div class="section-top">
    <h2>Software you can license, customize, or build on</h2>
    <p class="normal">My software can be licensed as-is, customized for your workflow, or used as the foundation for a larger engineering project. I bring reusable technology to the engagement instead of starting from scratch every time.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <a class="pcard card" href="/engineering/#license">
      <h3>License</h3>
      <p>Use Extropian software inside your organization under terms structured around your deployment and business requirements.</p>
      <span class="pcard-link">Services &amp; licensing →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="pcard card" href="/engineering/#customize">
      <h3>Customize</h3>
      <p>Start from an existing Extropian product and adapt it to your workflows, data, interfaces, and domain-specific requirements.</p>
      <span class="pcard-link">Services &amp; licensing →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="pcard card" href="/engineering/#build">
      <h3>Build on the ecosystem</h3>
      <p>Use the underlying Extropian software ecosystem as the technical foundation for a specialized application.</p>
      <span class="pcard-link">Services &amp; licensing →</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="ip" class="wrap section-block">
  <div class="section-top">
    <h2>Turn technical IP into usable software</h2>
    <p class="normal">Your models, solvers, algorithms, and research are valuable. I build the software around them so they can be used, explored, optimized, and deployed.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="background" class="wrap section-block">
  <div class="section-top">
    <h2>Engineering background</h2>
    <p class="normal">Scientific software engineering across simulation, real-time systems, and product development — from legacy code stewardship to GPU-era interactive tools.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="button button--ghost" href="/about/">More about Wes →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="workwithme" class="wrap section-block">
  <div class="section-top">
    <h2>Work with me</h2>
    <p class="normal">License existing software, customize a product, or build a specialized system on the Extropian ecosystem.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="button button--blue" href="/engineering/">Services &amp; licensing options</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="portfolio" class="wrap section-block">
  <div class="section-top">
    <h2>Past portfolio</h2>
    <p class="normal">Selected engineering and research software built over the years — from national-laboratory deployments to research platforms.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    {%- set featured = ['capars', 'hyperfat', 'autoligo', 'alphaact'] %}
    {%- for proj in portfolio %}
    {%- if proj.id in featured %}
      {% include "partials/project-card.njk" %}
    {%- endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="button button--ghost" href="/portfolio/">Full portfolio →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact-band">
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p class="normal">Describe your technical bottleneck or system. I respond within 24 hours.</p>
  <p><a class="email-big" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
</section>
